Help  ? / q / esc to close                        
                                                  
Global                          v                 
j        down                   ]f       next file
k        up                                       
gg       top                                      
G        bottom                                   
ctrl+d   half page down                           
ctrl+u   half page up                             
ctrl+f   page down                                
ctrl+b   page up                                  
                                                  
enter    open / select                            
o        open in browser                          
R        refresh                                  
/        filter / search                          
n        next match                               
N        previous match                           
                                                  
q        back (quit on root)                      
esc      cancel / clear                           
?        toggle help                              
ctrl+c   quit                                     






